DEVICECONFIGURATIOND(8)     System Manager's Manual    DEVICECONFIGURATIOND(8)

NAME
     deviceconfigurationd – Device Configuration Daemon

DESCRIPTION
     deviceconfigurationd persists effective configurations that conform to
     specifications authored by system components, and notifies interested
     parties about changes in those configurations.

